📊 Task 2 – Advertising Performance Dashboard (FUTURE_DS_02)
🎯 Objective

Build an interactive Tableau dashboard to analyze the advertising dataset and evaluate Ad Spend, Revenue, ROI, Profit, and Product Sold across multiple marketing channels.

🛠 Tools Used

Tableau Public – Visualization & Dashboard creation

Microsoft Excel / CSV – Data preparation

GitHub – Project documentation

📁 Dataset

The dataset contains key marketing metrics:

Ad Spend

Revenue

ROI (%)

Profit

Product Sold

Different marketing channels

📈 Insights from the Dashboard

📌 Social Media and Product Sold channels generated the highest conversions.

📌 ROI was highest for Product Sold channel (136%).

📌 Revenue trend is dominated by the Product Sold channel.

📌 Profit analysis reveals where marketing investment is most effective.

📌 The dashboard provides a clear comparison across channels for better decision-making.

